      "writtenOn": "2026-03-05T15:25:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this right? `A[i]` will be a column vector from the matrix, so this ends up doing:\n\n```\n[v1, v2, v3, v4][a1]\n                [a2]\n                [a3]\n                [a4]\n```\n\nSo, we\u0027re doing V * A, not A * V. We need to pull out row vectors from the matrix to do the other way or loop over columns/rows.",
      "revId": "89cf7b0d46eee889018d7bb6804bc3d64d7a281f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
